#: ../../source/assy.rst:2
msgid "Assembly YAML"
msgstr "Assembly YAML"

#: ../../source/assy.rst:6
msgid "Introduction"
msgstr "简介"

#: ../../source/assy.rst:8
msgid ""
"Assembly YAML is an approach to define assemblies using a simple YAML "
"file. This file format was introduced in PartCAD for the first time."
msgstr "Assembly YAML 是一种使用简单的 YAML 文件来定义装配体的方法。该文件格式在 PartCAD 中首次引入。"

#: ../../source/assy.rst:13
msgid "Syntax"
msgstr "语法"

#: ../../source/assy.rst:15
msgid ""
"Each Assembly YAML (ASSY) file is a YAML file consisting of a tree of "
"nodes. Each node is either a reference to an external part, a reference "
"to an external assembly, or a container for such references."
msgstr "每个 Assembly YAML（ASSY）文件都是一个由节点树构成的 YAML 文件。每个节点要么是对外部零件的引用，要么是对外部装配体的引用，要么是此类引用的容器。"

#: ../../source/assy.rst:20
msgid "Containers"
msgstr "容器"

